WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:02.210
How's the work going?

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:05.839
Mr. Kishibe,
you'd better concentrate on running.

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.758
I've accepted your challenge.

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:10.093
So it's already started.

00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:12.846
I won't screw up like last time.

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:15.348
I'll wipe the floor with you.

00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:17.851
Kishibe Rohan!

00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:22.147
Whoa!

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:30.363
Seventeen point two km/h.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:38.872
Your body, it's changed, hasn't it?

00:00:38.955 --> 00:00:43.084
Your name is Hashimoto Yoma, right?
You're 21, aren't you?

00:00:44.419 --> 00:00:47.047
Wow, look at your side muscles.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:48.798
How did you get like that?

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:52.177
Serratus anterior muscles?
That's not just any old six-pack.

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:57.807
The muscle definition is incredible.
I've never seen anything like that before.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:59.893
Why don't you just shut up and run?

00:00:59.976 --> 00:01:01.770
Now I've passed 18 km/h.

00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:07.817
What's that?

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:09.486
The shape of his muscles,

00:01:10.278 --> 00:01:11.654
what does this mean!?

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:14.115
Nineteen km/h.

00:01:14.199 --> 00:01:19.162
Mr. Kishibe, the last time you quickly
tapped the table&nbsp;with your fingers

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:22.415
and made the situation
advantageous for yourself…

00:01:23.666 --> 00:01:27.128
so that the remote would fall
into your hand.

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:31.091
It was a borderline case,
and you can't call that a victory.

00:01:31.174 --> 00:01:33.218
You can't have ambiguity
in a&nbsp;competition.

00:01:33.301 --> 00:01:35.678
This time you won't get away with it!

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:38.598
Wait a minute, this is just a&nbsp;game.

00:01:39.224 --> 00:01:42.435
Yes, what we're doing is just a game.

00:01:42.519 --> 00:01:46.439
Just playing around, but it has
to be fair to decide the winner.

00:01:46.981 --> 00:01:51.528
Especially for a rematch.
We've gotta decide fairly and squarely.

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:53.613
A rematch has to be done right!

00:01:53.696 --> 00:01:56.491
It's just that
you couldn't grab the remote.

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:58.785
Are you calling me a cheat?

00:01:58.827 --> 00:02:01.663
I'm just saying,
our game's gotta be fair.

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:02.622
What?!

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:10.630
What the hell is he doing?!

00:02:10.672 --> 00:02:13.633
Backwards?
He's running backwards on the&nbsp;belt?!

00:02:13.675 --> 00:02:16.094
At 20 km/h! Running backwards!

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:20.557
Wow, he's in such incredible shape!
But what's he playing at?

00:02:21.057 --> 00:02:23.268
Why is he running backwards?!

00:02:23.852 --> 00:02:26.646
Hey! What on earth are you…

